{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8ebdf181-1e89-8c9e-867e-178228a93b37",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:14:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Richard E. Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:13:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:13:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I need to get a certificate fixed. My birth certificate, I think. They spelled my last name wrong, C-H-A-S-E-S, with an extra S on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:13:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me make sure I have it. Your name is spelled Chase, but the certificate has Chases."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:13:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Well, no, it's the one from the hospital. The old Newport Hospital. Not the old one, the, the newer one. Anyway, is that you folks or the state?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Corrections usually start with an application, and I can send you the form. Are you born here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, born here. Sorry, my phone's ringing. That's the old flip phone ringtone from the nineties, I never changed it. Doesn't matter. How long does it take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Typically a few weeks once the paperwork is complete. Sometimes a bit longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. So the form, I fill that out, and then I send it where, to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can mail it or you can pick it up here. Can I get your mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, I'm still not sure I'm following. Can you say that once more, slower?"
    }
  ],
